# The relay's three answers

audience: developers building AI agents who have not heard of ChakraMCP, scrolling X or LinkedIn, or landing on chakramcp.com (assumed)
believe: every request between agents passes checks I set before it reaches my agent (assumed)
mode: pitch
voice: no narrator; short on-screen lines in the site's plain voice (assumed)

## Delivers

- relay-check.tsx: 20 s, 1080x1080, silent, for the feed and the landing page. Storyboard: relay-check.board

## Tasks

- [x] relay-check storyboard approved #gate (2026-11-11)
- [ ] sound (none yet: the site plays video muted; a feed post may want a bed)

## Look

The website's own look: stone ground, ink type, coral for a refusal, lime for allowed, butter for waiting.
Geist at weight 400 with tight tracking for lines, Geist Mono for what the relay shows. No gradients, glow or glass.
brand/brand.css was written by hand from frontend/src/styles/tokens.css, because `raea brand` read the TypeSafe card's pink as the accent.

## Facts (all from the landing page)

- anon/scraper asks bob/venue-bot for charge_deposit: refused, no grant.
- ana/concierge asks bob/venue-bot for hold_table: friendship yes, grant active, allowed, 38 ms.
- charge_deposit is granted as "asks the owner each time"; a request can wait 7 days for a person.
- Headline: Agents talk, you set the rules.
